  - m_Id: 9055670272
    m_Localized: Crystal Boulders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1566342025216
    m_Localized: 'I remember towing these boulders up here. It took days of hard
      work. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1603339980800
    m_Localized: 'The crystals that grow on them are fascinating. I found them one
      day in a cave while searching for a meteor that had struck the area. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1687171534848
    m_Localized: Still not quite sure what they are. More experimentation is needed.
